  "body": "Elevated and privately positioned in a sought-after Stanmore Bay cul-de-sac, this solid brick and block home enjoys wide urban views and has been beautifully refreshed throughout. Offering generous proportions, versatile living spaces and exceptional off-street parking, there's plenty to love here.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n- Solid brick and block construction\r\n- Three bedrooms plus separate downstairs rumpus room\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Wood burner for cosy winter evenings\r\n- Private, all-weather outdoor entertaining spaces\r\n- Beautifully landscaped, fully fenced freehold section\r\n- Town supply water\r\n- Spacious backyard with plenty of room for children and pets\r\n- Exceptional off-street parking for multiple vehicles, a boat, jet skis or caravan\r\n- Generous separate laundry with easy access to the washing line\r\n- Large woodshed plus two garden sheds\r\n- Sought-after cul-de-sac with a reserve and playground at the end of the street\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is light-filled and welcoming, with a fabulous wood burner creating warmth and ambience through the cooler months.\r\n\r\nOutdoor entertaining is a real highlight, and something the current owners have particularly loved about living here. Private, sheltered and designed for all-weather enjoyment, it's a fantastic extension of the home, perfect for entertaining friends and family or simply relaxing in your own space. Beautiful landscaping adds to the appeal, while the spacious, fully fenced backyard provides plenty of room for children and pets to enjoy.\r\n\r\nSpread across two levels, the layout offers excellent flexibility, with three double bedrooms and the added benefit of a separate downstairs rumpus room, ideal for growing families, teenagers, a second living area or working from home. A generous laundry with easy access to the backyard adds another practical touch.\r\n\r\nAnd if you've got plenty of toys, you're well catered for! Exceptional off-street parking provides room for the boat, jet skis, caravan or multiple vehicles, while a fully stocked woodshed and two additional garden sheds take care of the storage.\r\n\r\nThe location is another bonus. Enjoy the reserve and playground at the end of the cul-de-sac, beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches nearby and the convenience of the Whangaparaoa shopping district just a short drive away.",
